    "title": "Saturday AM forecast: Dry weekend gives way to a wetter pattern - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dave Baker ,\n21 hours ago The Capital Region stays dry this weekend, with sunshine, low humidity, and warm afternoons dominating the forecast. That quiet stretch lasts into the middle of next week before moisture begins building back into the region and rain chances increase. Today and Tonight: Saturday will be mostly sunny. Temperatures will climb... Read full article\n8",
